                  "Name": "COMPONENT_TREE",
                  "Description": "The component-type catalog the Architect must name its ComponentTypeRefs from. Without this the Architect invents type names from memory and its graph fails validation for referencing types that do not exist. Kind partitions the space (Model, Preprocessing, Statistic, Input, Output, Parameter, Structure); IsAbstract marks organizing nodes that carry inherited properties but cannot be instantiated; ParentID gives the inheritance chain a leaf's real capabilities come from.",
