              },
              {
                "fields": {
                  "AgentID": "@parent:ID",
                  "Name": "COMPONENT_SLOTS",
                  "Description": "The fillable positions each component type declares — what makes a compose decision possible. A Structure's slots say what it accepts and how many (a Bagging Wrapper's base_estimator, a Stacking Wrapper's estimators and final_estimator, a Glass-Box Rubric's weights). A composed graph is validated against exactly these, so an Architect that cannot see them is guessing at the shape it is being graded on.",
